# ── Local agent scaffolding — never published ──────────────────
# Regenerate with `npx skills add remotion-dev/skills`; skills-lock.json
# pins the versions and is committed. 3.4 MB of someone else's markdown
# does not belong in this history. Not just untidy, either: biome lints
# whatever is on disk, and .agents/ alone contributed 418 errors to
# `pnpm check` on a tree that is otherwise clean.
.agents/
.claude/
